{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33236","headline":"梅 · 温庭皓","name":"梅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一树寒林外，何人此地栽。\n春光先自煖，阳艳暗相催。\n晓觉霜添白，寒迷月借开。\n余香低惹袖，堕蘂逐流杯。\n零落移新煖，飘扬上故台。\n雪繁莺不识，风袅蝶空回。\n羌吹应愁起，征徒异渴来。\n莫贪题咏兴，商鼎待盐梅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}